Highly dispersed Pt clusters encapsulated in MIL-125-NH\(_2\) via in situ auto-reduction method for photocatalytic H\(_2\) production under visible light
Xiubing Huang\(^{\S}\) (✉), Xiangjun Li\(^{\S}\), Qingjie Luan\(^{\S}\), Kaiyue Zhang, Zhenyu Wu, Baozhen Li, Zuoshuai Xi, Wenjun Dong, and Ge Wang (✉)
